{"id":"vod_sn_38483","vodId":"38483","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"初恋怪兽","name_cn":"初恋怪兽","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/4520647cdc974e515c61dfea09df2081.jpg"},"summary":"二阶堂夏步（堀江由衣 配音）是个名副其实的千金大小姐，自幼备受呵护，不懂如何与同龄人来往，渐渐地养成毫无自信心、消极待物的性格。以升学为契机，她终于摆脱父母束缚，一个人搬进了住满各式租客的华住庄。在搬家当天，夏步险遭车祸，千钧一发之际，一个大帅哥（樱井孝宏 配音）及时出现，不但救了她一命，还狠狠训斥了她一顿。夏步对其一见钟情，正苦恼之际，她发现这个大帅哥居然和自己住在同一屋檐下。夏步冲动之下对其表白，然而这个有着帅气外表和173cm身高的大帅哥，竟然是个小学生！高中千金大小姐和逆天小学生“五年一班高桥”的名为“怪兽”的恋爱物语，正式展开。　　本剧改编自日本漫画家日吉丸晃的同名漫画作品。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:01:57","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iCfEVviJyp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zQRAews9we1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/i9mebfEUJS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WWLf3yCfGw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/e22Yr5GgxP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iLiBKy3Gdj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yrZi8JagR71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gHz5Bstfzb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QqjjSHhurM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DvvAFJPeNC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TDetUEM8WA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gSYiUKVTAL1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:58.513Z"}